From git@z Thu Jan  1 00:00:00 1970
Subject: [PATCH v7 3/7] power: supply: bq257xx: Make the default current
 limit a per-chip attribute
From: Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Date: Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:10:51 +0400
